FITTED FOR THE FUTURE
Exotic Weapons
Exotic Weapons are weapons that are overly specialized or too unique to be easily described. They are typically variants of existing weapon types. All Exotic Weapons are Average Weapon Quality and are incompatible with all Weapon Attachments and Non-Basic Ammunition unless otherwise stated. The table below offers a brief glimpse of Exotic Weapons.
